    "article": "Article 9",
    "provision": "Risk Management System",
    "requirement": "Continuous Risk Management System",
    "description": "High-risk AI systems must establish, implement, document, and maintain an iterative risk management system throughout their entire lifecycle, including identification and mitigation of foreseeable risks.",
